{"seq":2,"slug":"origin-qualification-engine","title":"原产地资格判定引擎与规则配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-determination-data/origin-qualification-engine","wordCount":1717,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"原产地资格判定引擎与规则配置\">原产地资格判定引擎与规则配置</h1><p>判定标准写在协定附件的表格里，是给人读的自然语言；而一台每天要判几千个 SKU、每个 SKU 对应十几个协定的引擎，需要的是结构化规则、可追溯的输入和可解释的输出。这一篇讲引擎的四个核心部件：规则库、BOM 展开、判定执行、以及结论的可解释性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>判定引擎的输入是 (SKU, 目标协定, 批次)，输出是一条带证据链的原产结论。中间要跨过三个鸿沟：规则从文档变成数据、BOM 从结构变成判定树、计算从一次性变成可复现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[SKU + 目标协定 + 批次] --&gt; B[规则库查询]&#10;  B --&gt; C{PSR 表达式树}&#10;  A --&gt; D[BOM 递归展开]&#10;  D --&gt; E[材料属性表]&#10;  E --&gt; F[累积与容忍前置]&#10;  F --&gt; G[判定执行器]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[结论 + 证据链]&#10;  H --&gt; I[缓存与失效]\">graph TD\n  A[SKU + 目标协定 + 批次] --&gt; B[规则库查询]\n  B --&gt; C{PSR 表达式树}\n  A --&gt; D[BOM 递归展开]\n  D --&gt; E[材料属性表]\n  E --&gt; F[累积与容忍前置]\n  F --&gt; G[判定执行器]\n  C --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[结论 + 证据链]\n  H --&gt; I[缓存与失效]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>关键设计约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则库</td>\n<td>存储 PSR、累积圈、容忍参数</td>\n<td>必须绑定协定版本与 HS 版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BOM 展开器</td>\n<td>递归分解到判定所需深度</td>\n<td>处理环、替代料、缺数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>判定执行器</td>\n<td>求值表达式树</td>\n<td>顺序固定：先累积后容忍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结论存储</td>\n<td>结论 + 可回溯证据</td>\n<td>记录输入快照与规则版本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存层</td>\n<td>避免重复判定</td>\n<td>失效条件必须覆盖规则与数据变更</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>五个部件中，最容易做错的是缓存。规则变更或供应商声明失效后，缓存结论必须同步失效，否则会继续输出基于旧规则的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规则库的数据模型\">规则库的数据模型</h2><h3 id=\"规则的三个维度\">规则的三个维度</h3><p>一条 PSR 由三维定位：<strong>协定</strong>（哪套规则）、<strong>HS 前缀与精度</strong>（管哪些货）、<strong>生效期间</strong>（什么时候的版本）。三维缺一不可，因为同一条 HS 在不同协定下规则不同，同一协定在不同年份也可能修订。</p>\n<h3 id=\"版本绑定\">版本绑定</h3><p>规则必须绑定到协定版本与 HS 版本。HS 每若干年修订一次，章目结构变化会让同一条规则指向不同的货。规则库里每条记录都带 <code>effective_from</code> 与 <code>effective_to</code>，查询时按批次日期取当年有效版本，禁止用「当前最新」规则回判历史批次。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE agreement_rule_version (&#10;  agreement       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  version_tag     TEXT NOT NULL,     -- &#39;RCEP-PSR-2026&#39;&#10;  hs_revision     TEXT NOT NULL,     -- &#39;HS2022&#39;&#10;  published_at    DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from  DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to    DATE,&#10;  source_url      TEXT NOT NULL,     -- 规则文本来源，供审计&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (agreement, version_tag)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE accumulation_circle (&#10;  agreement       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  version_tag     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  member_code     TEXT NOT NULL,     -- ISO 国家码&#10;  accumulation_kind TEXT NOT NULL,   -- &#39;BILATERAL&#39;|&#39;DIAGONAL&#39;|&#39;FULL&#39;|&#39;NONE&#39;&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (agreement, version_tag, member_code)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> agreement_rule_version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agreement       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_tag     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'RCEP-PSR-2026'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_revision     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'HS2022'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  published_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  source_url      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 规则文本来源，供审计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (agreement, version_tag)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> accumulation_circle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agreement       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  version_tag     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  member_code     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ISO 国家码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  accumulation_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 'BILATERAL'|'DIAGONAL'|'FULL'|'NONE'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (agreement, version_tag, member_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"规则的导入与校验\">规则的导入与校验</h3><p>规则从协定 PDF 与附件表格导入，必须经过两步校验：结构校验（表达式能否解析成树）与业务校验（阈值是否落在协定允许范围、层级是否合法）。无法解析的规则不能静默丢弃，要进入人工复核队列并阻断相关 HS 的判定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"规则源的权威性\">规则源的权威性</h3><p>规则文本必须来自协定官方渠道，而非二手汇编。规则表里的 <code>source_url</code> 字段不是装饰——核查或审计时，一条判定能否成立取决于它所依据的规则是否出自有效文本。WTO 纪律要求成员的优惠原产地规则按 GATT 第 X:1 条标准公布，并向秘书处通报其优惠规则及后续修改（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/docs_e/legal_e/22-roo_e.htm\">WTO 原产地规则协定附件二</a>）。这条纪律在工程上意味着一份可追溯的规则变更日志，而不是一份不断被覆盖的规则表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bom-展开与判定树\">BOM 展开与判定树</h2><h3 id=\"展开停止条件\">展开停止条件</h3><p>递归展开在满足任一条件时停止：物料本身已被确认为原产、物料所在层低于规则要求的最浅判定层级、或数据缺失需人工补录。停止条件决定了判定的计算量，不能一刀切展开全树。</p>\n<h3 id=\"材料状态机\">材料状态机</h3><p>每个材料节点有四种状态，判定执行器按状态分流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;material_id&quot;: &quot;MOTOR-BLDC-12V&quot;,&#10;  &quot;states&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;ORIGINATING&quot;: &quot;已确认为原产，直接计入 VOM&quot;,&#10;    &quot;NON_ORIGINATING&quot;: &quot;确认为非原产，计入 VNM&quot;,&#10;    &quot;UNKNOWN&quot;: &quot;缺数据，CTC 下按不满足，RVC 下计入 VNM&quot;,&#10;    &quot;ACCUMULABLE&quot;: &quot;非原产但属累积圈，按原产回填&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;suppressed_reason&quot;: null&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"material_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MOTOR-BLDC-12V\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"states\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ORIGINATING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"已确认为原产，直接计入 VOM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"NON_ORIGINATING\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"确认为非原产，计入 VNM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"UNKNOWN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"缺数据，CTC 下按不满足，RVC 下计入 VNM\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ACCUMULABLE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"非原产但属累积圈，按原产回填\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"suppressed_reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"替代料的多路径求值\">替代料的多路径求值</h3><p>同一物料位有替代料时，判定对每条合法路径分别求值。只要有一条路径通过，结论即为通过，并记录是哪个替代料组合达成的——这条记录在核查时是自证材料，因为海关可能质疑实际用的是哪一批。</p>\n<h2 id=\"判定执行器\">判定执行器</h2><h3 id=\"固定的求值顺序\">固定的求值顺序</h3><p>执行顺序必须是：材料状态归类 → 累积回填 → PSR 表达式求值 → 容忍兜底。顺序颠倒会得出错误结论，见 <a href=\"../origin-criteria/accumulation-de-minimis-tolerance\">累积规则与微小含量容忍</a> 中对先累积后容忍的论证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"表达式树的短路求值\">表达式树的短路求值</h3><p><code>or</code> 节点左支为真即返回，不再计算右支。这不只是性能考虑，也是行为正确性要求：右支可能依赖未采集的数据，短路可以避免因缺数据而误判失败。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计算精度与舍入\">计算精度与舍入</h3><p>RVC 计算涉及百分比，舍入方向会影响边界案例的通过与否。标准做法是按协定的有效位数计算，比较时用严格大于或大于等于（依规则文本），并在结论中记录未舍入的原始值供复核。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;BT-EARBUD-A1&quot;,&#10;  &quot;batch&quot;: &quot;2026-Q3-0417&quot;,&#10;  &quot;agreement&quot;: &quot;RCEP&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rule_version&quot;: &quot;RCEP-PSR-2026&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rule_matched&quot;: &quot;HS8518.30 @ CTH or RVC40&quot;,&#10;  &quot;trace&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;non_originating_value&quot;: 3.42,&#10;    &quot;transaction_value&quot;: 8.6,&#10;    &quot;rvc_raw&quot;: 60.2325,&#10;    &quot;rvc_rounded&quot;: 60.23,&#10;    &quot;accumulation_applied&quot;: [&quot;CN&quot;, &quot;JP&quot;],&#10;    &quot;de_minimis_used&quot;: false&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;verdict&quot;: &quot;QUALIFIED&quot;,&#10;  &quot;criterion_used&quot;: &quot;RVC40&quot;,&#10;  &quot;assumptions&quot;: []&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BT-EARBUD-A1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"batch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-Q3-0417\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"agreement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RCEP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RCEP-PSR-2026\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rule_matched\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HS8518.30 @ CTH or RVC40\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"trace\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"non_originating_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"transaction_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8.6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rvc_raw\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60.2325</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rvc_rounded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60.23</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"accumulation_applied\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JP\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"de_minimis_used\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"verdict\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"QUALIFIED\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"criterion_used\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RVC40\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"assumptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"结论的不可变与重判\">结论的不可变与重判</h3><p>结论一旦用于出证就不应被原地修改。数据更新后产生的是<strong>新结论</strong>，与旧结论并列保留，并标明变更原因。这样才能回答「为什么三个月前这批货判过、现在又判不过」这类核查问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结论可解释性与缓存\">结论可解释性与缓存</h2><h3 id=\"证据链的三段\">证据链的三段</h3><p>任何结论都要能回答三件事：用了哪条规则、算了哪些值、这些值来自哪份证据。第三段是最常被省略的，也是核查时最要命的——只有数值没有证据来源，等于无法自证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"缓存失效条件\">缓存失效条件</h3><p>缓存键是 (SKU, 协定, 规则版本, BOM 版本, 数据摘要)。失效必须由四类事件触发：规则版本切换、BOM 版本更新、供应商声明到期或撤回、材料价格重估。漏掉任一类都会输出过期结论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"批量判定的成本控制\">批量判定的成本控制</h3><p>全量判定所有 SKU 对全量协定代价过高。可行策略是分层：先按 HS 前缀快速筛掉明显不适用的协定，再对候选集做完整求值；同时对未变更输入的 (SKU, 协定) 复用结论。分层筛选用的是规则库里的 HS 覆盖范围，不是业务猜测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>判定引擎的核心部件是规则库、BOM 展开器、执行器、结论存储与缓存。</li>\n<li>PSR 必须三维定位：协定、HS 前缀与精度、生效期间；禁止用最新规则回判历史批次。</li>\n<li>材料状态机四态：原产、非原产、未知、可累积；未知不可默认归边。</li>\n<li>求值顺序固定为先累积后容忍，表达式树用短路求值避免缺数据误判。</li>\n<li>结论不可变，重判产生新结论并标明原因，保留旧结论供核查对照。</li>\n<li>缓存失效必须覆盖规则、BOM、声明、价格四类变更事件。</li>\n<li>引擎输出的多个合格协定会进入择优环节，见 <a href=\"agreement-rate-best-eligibility\">多协定税率选择与最优享惠</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原产地资格判定引擎与规则配置","id":"原产地资格判定引擎与规则配置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"规则库的数据模型","id":"规则库的数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"规则的三个维度","id":"规则的三个维度"},{"level":3,"text":"版本绑定","id":"版本绑定"},{"level":3,"text":"规则的导入与校验","id":"规则的导入与校验"},{"level":3,"text":"规则源的权威性","id":"规则源的权威性"},{"level":2,"text":"BOM 展开与判定树","id":"bom-展开与判定树"},{"level":3,"text":"展开停止条件","id":"展开停止条件"},{"level":3,"text":"材料状态机","id":"材料状态机"},{"level":3,"text":"替代料的多路径求值","id":"替代料的多路径求值"},{"level":2,"text":"判定执行器","id":"判定执行器"},{"level":3,"text":"固定的求值顺序","id":"固定的求值顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"表达式树的短路求值","id":"表达式树的短路求值"},{"level":3,"text":"计算精度与舍入","id":"计算精度与舍入"},{"level":3,"text":"结论的不可变与重判","id":"结论的不可变与重判"},{"level":2,"text":"结论可解释性与缓存","id":"结论可解释性与缓存"},{"level":3,"text":"证据链的三段","id":"证据链的三段"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存失效条件","id":"缓存失效条件"},{"level":3,"text":"批量判定的成本控制","id":"批量判定的成本控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"底层 BOM 与供应商原料原产数据采集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-determination-data/bom-supplier-origin-data"},"next":{"title":"多协定税率选择与最优享惠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/fta-preferential-origin-certificate/origin-determination-data/agreement-rate-best-eligibility"}}